@startuml ARCH-layered
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam dpi 150
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam rectangleBackgroundColor white
skinparam packageBackgroundColor white
skinparam ranksep 28
top to bottom direction
title ARCH-layered: Layered Architecture with MVC Responsibilities
' Sources: DEC-93/102/105/108/109; CD-final; CMP-system; NFR-05/08/11/13.
actor "Manager / Staff / IT Administrator" as Users
rectangle "<b>Presentation / client tier — browser</b>\n\nView: LandingPage · JobAllocationPage · CsvUploadPage\nRender results and forward input (other pages: Table 2.1).\n\nClient Controller: OfflineAssignmentController\nLandingPage → loadToday / local unlock / logout clear\nOwns the bounded encrypted today-only Assignment copy." as Browser
rectangle "<b>Application tier — on-site server</b>\n\nUC-07: RosterController.checkCsvReadiness / prepareSuggestion\n→ StandbyPreferenceController.confirmWeek\n→ CrewFormingService.suggestRoster → RuleValidator\n\nUC-16: CsvImportController.upload / validateWeek\n→ CsvRowMapper adapters → atomic snapshot and audit\n\nUC-13: OfflineAssignmentController → DashboardController.loadStaffHome\n→ successful online result refreshes the client copy\n\nOther controllers: Table 2.1. NotificationService → Email/SMS gateways." as Application
rectangle "<b>Data / Model tier — on-site server</b>\n\nCsvImport.coversWeek · LeaveRecord · VanAvailability\nAvailability · StandbyPreference · Crew · Assignment\nStaff.activeHoursOn / hoursOn · AuditLog.record\n(and remaining entities / enumerations)" as Model
database "Workload database — on-site\nAuthoritative records and logs" as DB
Users --> Browser : role-specific interaction
Browser --> Application : use-case requests / returned page data
Application --> Model : read/change entities and derive values
Model --> DB : persist
legend bottom
MVC roles differ from physical tiers: the browser has a View and client Controller.
Offline scope/lifecycle remain DEC-102/105; cryptography and key lifecycle need verification.
Adapted Data/Model grouping retains entity behaviour; use-case coordination stays Application.
endlegend
@enduml
